{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"exercise.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0","title":"二分查找首次匹配","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"lessonRef":{"id":"lesson.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0"},"learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":[],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.binary-search","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.arrays","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.conditions","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.loops","version":"1.0.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.practice-binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0"},"judgeRef":{"id":"judge.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0"},"prompt":"values长度0..30，必须已经非递减，乱序会被输入校验拒绝而不会替你排序。输出首次0基下标或-1。target和元素在-999..999；九组固定测试包含空、单项、两端、重复及各种未命中。\n\n教学目标：非递减输入上闭区间迭代，安全中点，比较缩区间；命中保存候选并继续左侧，输出首次下标或-1。\n\n所有测试都须正常结束且main返回0。必须让当前真实执行的数据与控制过程满足目标，不能用固定答案、死读取或未执行结构代替。","tests":[{"caseKey":"empty","input":{"values":[],"target":2},"expectedStdout":"-1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"one-hit","input":{"values":[2],"target":2},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"one-miss","input":{"values":[2],"target":3},"expectedStdout":"-1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"first","input":{"values":[-2,0,3],"target":-2},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"last","input":{"values":[-2,0,3],"target":3},"expectedStdout":"2\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"duplicate","input":{"values":[-2,0,0,0,3],"target":0},"expectedStdout":"1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"absent-low","input":{"values":[1,3],"target":-1},"expectedStdout":"-1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"absent-high","input":{"values":[1,3],"target":4},"expectedStdout":"-1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"absent-middle","input":{"values":[1,3],"target":2},"expectedStdout":"-1\n","expectedExitCode":0}],"rewardRef":{"id":"reward.exercise.first-pass","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.practice-binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0","title":"二分查找首次匹配参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"values":[-2,0,0,4,8],"target":0},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 5;\n    int values[5] = {-2, 0, 0, 4, 8};\n    int target = 0;\n    int left = 0;\n    int right = n - 1;\n    int answer = -1;\n    while (left <= right) {\n        int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;\n        if (values[mid] >= target) {\n            if (values[mid] == target) {\n                answer = mid;\n            }\n            right = mid - 1;\n        } else {\n            left = mid + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", answer);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.n","inputKey":"values","targetName":"n","targetKind":"logical-length","from":"length-of"},{"bindingKey":"param.values","inputKey":"values","targetName":"values","targetKind":"array","from":"field","emptyStorage":"one-zero-placeholder"},{"bindingKey":"param.target","inputKey":"target","targetName":"target","targetKind":"scalar","from":"field"}],"blockRefs":[{"id":"block.c.main","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.integer","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-int","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.assign-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.unary","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.printf","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.return","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.while","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.if","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.comparison","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.arithmetic","version":"1.0.0"}],"reference":{"document":"项目文档/验收/P0.5-09-正文审校.md","locator":"08.04；项目原创；受P0-C约束"}},"inputSpec":{"id":"input.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0","title":"二分查找首次匹配输入","fields":[{"key":"values","kind":"sequence","min":-999,"max":999,"minItems":0,"maxItems":30},{"key":"target","kind":"integer","min":-999,"max":999}],"relations":[{"kind":"length-of","field":"values","target":"n"},{"kind":"nondecreasing","field":"values"}]},"judgeProfile":{"id":"judge.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0","title":"二分查找首次匹配教学检查","rule":"binary-first-index","targetDescription":"非递减输入上闭区间迭代，安全中点，比较缩区间；命中保存候选并继续左侧，输出首次下标或-1。"}}